ns output over repeated invalid attempts: reject the invalid action and direct the agent to the exact valid action shown (e.g., unstack the covering block first), then proceed with the goal build.'], 'finalizer': ['When When pouring from a shaker into a shot glass and the intended target shot is not listed among valid pour actions: After check-valid-actions, only execute pour-shaker-to-shot with the exact target shot and level pair listed as valid; if the desired shot is absent, switch to a listed valid target or free/clean the intended shot first rather than retrying the same invalid action.', 'When When transporting multiple objects from one location to another with limited carrying capacity per trip: Batch objects in pairs per trip: pick one object per hand, move to the destination, drop both, then return for the next pair; before picking, verify the object is not already being carried to avoid invalid actions.', 'When When a desired block is not directly pickable because it is buried under another block, and a direct pickup action fails as invalid.: After an invalid pickup, run check-valid-actions to identify the blocking relationship, then unstack the covering block first (or pick a valid alternative) before retrying; avoid repeating the same invalid pickup.', "Act directly: output exactly ONE concrete executable action per turn. Do not output 'think:' steps; if you are unsure which actions are valid, output 'check valid actions'."]}
